---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use | Irving College Baptist Church">
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Irving College Baptist Church</p>
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="updated">Effective September 29, 2026</p>

      <p>
        These Terms of Use apply to the official Irving College Baptist Church ("ICBC," "we," "us," or
        "our") Roku app and the livestream and sermon content made available through it. By using the app,
        you agree to these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Purpose of the App</h2>
      <p>
        The ICBC Roku app provides access to church livestreams, recent sermons, and related ministry content.
        The app is provided free of charge and does not require a subscription or user account.
      </p>

      <h2>Church Content</h2>
      <p>
        Unless otherwise indicated, sermons, graphics, branding, and other original content made available by
        ICBC are owned by or used with permission of Irving College Baptist Church. The app and its content are
        provided for personal, noncommercial viewing. You may not reproduce, redistribute, sell, modify, or
        commercially exploit ICBC content without permission or other legal authorization.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-Party Content and Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Some services may include music, quotations, media, or other material owned by third parties. Those
        materials remain subject to the rights of their respective owners and any applicable licenses or
        permissions.
      </p>

      <h2>Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p>
        You may not attempt to interfere with the app or streaming service, gain unauthorized access to our
        systems, misuse the service in a way that disrupts access for others, or use the app for unlawful
        purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>Availability</h2>
      <p>
        We work to keep livestreams and archived sermons available, but we do not guarantee uninterrupted or
        error-free access. Livestream schedules, archived content, features, and availability may change without
        notice because of technical issues, ministry scheduling, licensing considerations, or other operational
        needs.
      </p>

      <h2>Roku Platform</h2>
      <p>
        The ICBC app is distributed for use on the Roku platform. Your use of Roku devices and Roku platform
        services is also subject to the terms and policies that apply to your relationship with Roku.
      </p>

      <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        The app and its content are provided on an "as available" basis. To the extent permitted by applicable
        law, ICBC disclaims warranties regarding uninterrupted availability, compatibility, or freedom from
        technical errors.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the extent permitted by applicable law, ICBC will not be liable for indirect, incidental, special, or
        consequential losses arising from use of, or inability to use, the app or streaming service.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms of Use as the app or our streaming services change. The effective date at the
        top of this page will be updated when changes are made. Continued use of the app after an update means
        you accept the revised terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these Terms of Use may be sent to
        <a href="mailto:thecollegepastor83@gmail.com">thecollegepastor83@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    background: #f7f8f7;
    color: #202624;
    padding: 72px 20px 90px;
  }

  .legal-wrap {
    width: min(860px, 100%);
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 58px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: #2d8b68;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .updated {
    margin: 12px 0 34px;
    color: #69736f;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 34px 0 10px;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  a {
    color: #237a5a;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
